<title>NETHERLANDS: Stork unit to build NZ milk powder plant.</title>
<headline>Stork unit to build NZ milk powder plant.</headline>
<dateline>NAARDEN, Netherlands 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stork Friesland, a unit of industrial group Stork NV, is to build a large powdered milk factory in New Zealand for Kiwi Dairies, Stork said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The factory will have the capacity to process 160 tonnes of milk into 20 tonnes of milk powder per hour, the company said in a statement. Payment for the development work would total &quot;several tens of millions of guilders&quot;, it added.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
